# send phishing email disguised as newsletter, and send them to any mailbox
# without explict consent/subscription/confirmation.
#
# Their short URL service is also abused by phishers to hide the real destination
# of the link, and they have no plan to fix it.
#
# They refuse to fix their platform abuse problem. Blocking them does more good
# than harm.
#
# See also:
# https://www.reddit.com/r/Substack/comments/123upme/didnt_subscribe_but_getting_emails/
# https://www.reddit.com/r/Substack/comments/1bwxekz/never_experienced_so_much_spam/
# https://medium.com/pitfall/how-bad-is-subscribing-spam-on-substack-02f3d228be82
# https://om.co/2023/05/14/substack-spam/
# https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=43199314
#
# See also:
# https://github.com/SukkaW/Surge/pull/98#pullrequestreview-4048399949
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,substack.com



